Z||000000||Ralph||05-04-2001||07:58 PM||||Hello everyone, Will some nice person please measure the location of the FORMULA door decal for me? I would like to know the distance from the bottom of the decal to the bottom of the door edge and the distance from the trailing edge of thr decal to the trailing edge of the door. I am planning on putting on tomorrow. Anyone's help would be appreciated.<P>Ralph<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/yellowformula/LittleFiero.jpg">   <BR>  <B>  Ralph </B>||||reg||1
